data: {"id": "87b95b89ca46403c-thinking-parallel_evidence-3041", "run_id": "87b95b89ca46403c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 层面\n- **Pod 状态**: `aiops-case-v03/workload` 处于 **Pending** 阶段，`node: <none>`（未调度）。\n- **Pod 生命周期指标 (Prometheus)**: `kube_pod_status_phase` 显示 `Pending=1`，其余 phase 均为 0。UID `f9bb938b-5c0f-41e9-bf89-1bceec30da96` 确认身份一致。\n- **调度事件 (Events)**: 单条 **Warning FailedScheduling**，完整原文为：\n  > `0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.`\n  此即 `PodScheduled=False` 的 `Unschedulable` 原因。\n- **Pod Spec (YAML)**:\n  - 容器 `app` 使用镜像 `python:3-alpine`，request", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788863791176, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

