data: {"id": "87b95b89ca46403c-thinking-parallel_evidence-4338", "run_id": "87b95b89ca46403c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 执行说明\n\n根据既有 evidence_plan，本轮需要执行两个关键 Kubernetes 工具调用：\n1. `kubectl_describe` 获取 Pod 状态、容器终态和事件\n2. `query_pod_topology` 获取 Pod 的控制器、节点、Service 关系\n\nMetrics、Logging、Tracing 已在 pre-react 阶段完成：\n- **Metrics**: ✅ `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: ContainerCreating), `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending), restarts=0\n- **Logging**: ✅ 空（ContainerCreating 阶段容器未启动，日志为空符合预期）\n- **Tracing**: ✅ 空（pod_ip 为空，无法查询 DeepFlow flow；同样符合预期）\n\n现在开始执行计划中的 Kubernetes 工具调用。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788864292663, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

