    memory:     8Mi\n    Environment:  <none>\n    Mounts:\nVolumes:\n  input:\n    Type:          HostPath (bare host directory volume)\n    Path:          /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  89s (x5 over 10m)   kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n  Warning  FailedMount  20s (x14 over 12m)  kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/87b95b89ca46403c-g2-p3/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/87b95b89ca46403c-g2-p3/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/87b95b89ca46403c-g2-p3/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

