data: {"id": "87b95b89ca46403c-thinking-parallel_evidence-5035", "run_id": "87b95b89ca46403c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集完成 — 关键事实汇总\n\n### 支持 ContainerCreating 根因的强证据\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态：Pending (ContainerCreating)**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 调度到 `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- 容器状态：`Waiting`，reason=`ContainerCreating`，无 Container ID（容器未启动）\n- restarts=0（无历史重启）\n\n**2. 核心事件：FailedMount — hostPath 类型检查失败**\n```\nWarning  FailedMount  20s (x14 over 12m)  kubelet\n  MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" :\n  hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory\n```\n```\nWarning  Fa", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788864303264, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

